Good morning,

Have you corresponded with Daniel Chung? He tells me that the door to the
laundry services has been locked this weekend. He wants to file a claim for
reimbursement for the lack of laundry services for 3 weeks since February
2, 2024. He also has not received correspondence from the landlord in
regards to this matter.

We need to know what the expectations are for tenant use of laundry
services per week. I believe it is a reasonable expectation to do 3 loads
of laundry (including both washer and dryer cycles) each week. However,
because this service withdrawal has implied travel costs and inconvenience
this must also be included in the claim.

Thank you,
Evan Rosner

